---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../../components/PageHero.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy | Quick"
  description="Cookie Policy for Quick explaining strictly necessary cookies, optional analytics cookies, and user choices."
  canonicalPath="/cookie-policy/"
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Cookie Policy"
    description="How we use cookies and similar technologies on paywithquick.co.uk in line with UK PECR and UK GDPR."
    imageSrc="/images/copertina.webp"
    imageAlt="Cookie and consent policy"
  />

  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container stack">
      <article class="surface-card feature-card">
        <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 13 March 2026</p>
        <p>
          This Cookie Policy explains what cookies are, how we use them, and your choices on
          `paywithquick.co.uk`.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="surface-card feature-card">
        <h2>1. What are cookies?</h2>
        <p>
          Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help websites function,
          remember preferences, and measure performance.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="surface-card feature-card">
        <h2>2. Cookies we use</h2>
        <h3>Strictly necessary cookies</h3>
        <p>
          Required for core website functionality and security. These cannot be turned off.
        </p>

        <h3>Optional analytics cookies</h3>
        <p>
          Used only with your consent to understand site usage and improve performance.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="surface-card feature-card">
        <h2>3. Consent choices</h2>
        <p>
          On first visit, you can accept or reject optional cookies using our consent banner.
          Your choice is stored and can be changed by clearing site cookies/local storage and reloading the website.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="surface-card feature-card">
        <h2>4. Current cookie usage summary</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Consent preference:</strong> stores your cookie decision.</li>
          <li><strong>Essential operation:</strong> supports core page delivery and security.</li>
          <li><strong>Optional analytics:</strong> enabled only if you accept.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="surface-card feature-card">
        <h2>5. Managing cookies in your browser</h2>
        <p>
          You can also block or delete cookies through your browser settings. Note that disabling strictly necessary cookies
          may affect website functionality.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="surface-card feature-card">
        <h2>6. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For questions about cookies, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:info@paywithquick.co.uk">info@paywithquick.co.uk</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
